{"seq":1,"slug":"economics","title":"经济学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"经济学-简介\">经济学 简介</h1><p>经济学研究人类社会如何在资源稀缺的约束下做出选择。本 hub 是<strong>大学层次的系统经济学教程</strong>：以严密的数理模型为骨架，从个体决策（微观）讲到国家经济（宏观），再延伸到发展中国家的特殊挑战（发展经济学）与用数据检验理论的实证方法（计量经济学）。目标读者是想打牢经济学理论基础、能读懂模型推导的自学者与学生。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>知识库里有多个与经济、金融相关的 hub，定位各不相同。先看清边界，避免找错地方：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>本 hub（大学经济学）</strong></td>\n<td>学院派理论体系：供需、效用、IS-LM、索洛模型、OLS、因果推断</td>\n<td>提供理论与方法论根基</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../../../economics-finance/economics-thinking/microeconomics/supply-and-demand\">经济学与金融思维</a></td>\n<td>面向实践者的&quot;经济学思维&quot;+ 金融工程入门</td>\n<td>同一概念的<strong>应用与直觉</strong>版本（如弹性、博弈论、行为经济学），可与本 hub 互为表里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../../../mathematics-statistics/probability-statistics/probability-foundations/sample-space-events\">数学与统计</a></td>\n<td>线性代数、概率统计、微积分</td>\n<td>本 hub 的<strong>数学前置</strong>：最小二乘、假设检验、最优化、定积分都在那里有严格证明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../../../quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/pricing-foundations/stochastic-calculus\">量化金融</a></td>\n<td>衍生品定价、因子模型、算法交易</td>\n<td>把计量与随机分析推向金融市场的<strong>专业深化</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../../../personal-finance-investing/asset-allocation/theory-foundations/efficient-market-hypothesis\">个人理财与投资</a></td>\n<td>资产配置、税务、退休规划</td>\n<td>经济金融原理在<strong>个人决策</strong>上的落地，几乎不含模型推导</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：想理解&quot;为什么&quot;和&quot;模型怎么推&quot;，留在本 hub；想看&quot;怎么用&quot;，去 14；缺数学工具，去 13。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节地图与推荐学习路径\">章节地图与推荐学习路径</h2><p>本 hub 四章构成&quot;理论 → 实证&quot;的完整链条：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 微观经济学</strong>——供给与需求、消费者理论、市场结构。理解资源配置效率与市场失灵的核心工具箱。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 宏观经济学</strong>——国民收入核算、货币与财政政策、经济增长理论。从单个市场上升到整个经济体。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 发展经济学</strong>——贫困与不平等、贸易与发展、制度经济学。把经济分析接入现实世界的复杂性。</li>\n<li><strong>第四章 计量经济学</strong>——回归分析、时间序列、因果推断。用数据检验前三章的假说。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>按人群的推荐路径：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>零基础自学者</strong>：严格按 微观 → 宏观 顺序读完前两章，建立&quot;价格—市场—政策&quot;的完整直觉，再据兴趣选第三或第四章。微观第一篇<a href=\"microeconomics/supply-demand-equilibrium\">供给与需求均衡</a>是全 hub 的起点。</li>\n<li><strong>关注现实议题（贫困、发展、政策）</strong>：微观（至少供需、市场结构）→ 宏观（增长理论）→ 第三章发展经济学。</li>\n<li><strong>偏数据与实证方向</strong>：先补足<a href=\"../../../../mathematics-statistics/probability-statistics/probability-foundations/sample-space-events\">数学与统计</a>中的概率统计与线性代数 → 微观/宏观任一章建立经济直觉 → 直奔第四章计量经济学，其中<a href=\"econometrics/causal-inference-methods\">因果推断方法</a>是当前实证研究的前沿。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>必备</strong>：高中代数、函数与图像；理解&quot;边际&quot;&quot;斜率&quot;的直觉。</li>\n<li><strong>微观/宏观</strong>：单变量微积分（求导、定积分），多元函数偏导与约束最优化（拉格朗日法）——见<a href=\"../../../../mathematics-statistics/calculus-applications/differential-calculus/differential-applications\">微分应用</a>与<a href=\"../../../../mathematics-statistics/calculus-applications/multivariable-calculus/gradient-optimization\">梯度与最优化</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>计量经济学</strong>：概率论、随机变量与分布、假设检验（见<a href=\"../../../../mathematics-statistics/probability-statistics/hypothesis-testing/testing-fundamentals\">假设检验基础</a>），以及线性代数中的<a href=\"../../../../mathematics-statistics/linear-algebra/linear-equations/least-squares\">最小二乘</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>经济学的真正乐趣在于用模型解释身边的现象，边学边对照现实经济事件会事半功倍。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"microeconomics","title":"微观经济学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/microeconomics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supply-demand-equilibrium","title":"供给与需求均衡","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/microeconomics/supply-demand-equilibrium"},{"seq":2,"slug":"consumer-theory","title":"消费者理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/microeconomics/consumer-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"market-structures","title":"市场结构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/microeconomics/market-structures"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"macroeconomics","title":"宏观经济学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/macroeconomics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"national-income-accounting","title":"国民收入核算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/macroeconomics/national-income-accounting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"monetary-fiscal-policy","title":"货币与财政政策","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/macroeconomics/monetary-fiscal-policy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"economic-growth-theory","title":"经济增长理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/macroeconomics/economic-growth-theory"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"development-economics","title":"发展经济学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/development-economics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"poverty-inequality","title":"贫困与不平等","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/development-economics/poverty-inequality"},{"seq":2,"slug":"trade-and-development","title":"贸易与发展","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/development-economics/trade-and-development"},{"seq":3,"slug":"institutional-economics","title":"制度经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/development-economics/institutional-economics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"econometrics","title":"计量经济学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/econometrics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"regression-analysis","title":"回归分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/econometrics/regression-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"time-series-econometrics","title":"时间序列计量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/econometrics/time-series-econometrics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"causal-inference-methods","title":"因果推断方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/economics/econometrics/causal-inference-methods"}]}]}